+
+Only Python AST parsing and exact fixture/capsule/runtime-copy hashes were checked. No scratch controls or installer main execution occurred. Independent review was requested before the diagnostic hold; any remaining findings are recorded separately. Exclusive-file failure/rollback handling needs further review before an executable successor. Actual WPT lint has not been established by this draft; root plans to run the real WPT linter on the canonical path after a future authorized installation. Existing fixture records establish enumeration/manifest/transport only.
